    "Sending it again installs the app again; if it is already installed, you are asked before it is replaced." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le renvoyer installe l’app à nouveau ; si elle est déjà installée, l’app te demande avant de la remplacer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sending it again replaces the save on the console, even if it was already received and you played since. The current save is kept as a backup copy first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le renvoyer remplace la sauvegarde de la console, même si elle était déjà arrivée et que tu as joué depuis. La sauvegarde actuelle est d’abord gardée en copie de secours."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sending it again replaces this state on the console, even if it was already received. The current state goes to the trash first." : {
